    "Submitted but unconfirmed. Noah will keep trying the broadcast. Do not board these funds again.": {
      "comment": "GT gt_95e5ff4198a9aea1; arguments: none",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Submitted but unconfirmed. Noah will keep trying the broadcast. Do not board these funds again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enviado, pero sin confirmar. Noah seguirá intentando difundirlo. No vuelvas a depositar estos fondos."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "送信済みですが未確認です。Noahは引き続きブロードキャストを試みます。この資金を再びArkに入金しないでください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "제출되었지만 확정되지 않았습니다. Noah가 계속 전파를 시도합니다. 이 자금을 다시 입금하지 마세요."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skickad men obekräftad. Noah fortsätter att försöka sända transaktionen. Sätt inte in dessa medel igen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Submitted, awaiting broadcast. Noah will keep retrying the broadcast. Do not send this payment again.": {
      "comment": "GT gt_b50137cc6d52c59c; arguments: none",
